do_1 = "Extend tests/programs/test_ai_host_boundary.c:275 and its command handling at :991 to expose the actual signed CALL activity bytes and submit supplied bytes through production decoding, signature verification and authority resolution before kernel execution; do not regenerate a signature when accepting a supplied request, and never set signature_valid before those checks succeed."
do_2 = "Add reward_signed_replay_authentication to programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/tests/rewards_native.rs using Native::start at :1640 and the production snapshot reopening at tests/programs/test_ai_host_boundary.c:829: produce Claim and RefundFree through the real market lifecycle, retain their signed native activities, discard successful replies, reopen the store, and resubmit the retained bytes through the authenticated path with retained results and unchanged payout state."
do_3 = "For each operation, submit a changed payload under its original signature and a changed signature through the same production authentication path, assert the concrete authentication refusal and unchanged market state, recipient balances and events, and verify that an envelope actor differing from the authenticated native principal is refused; preserve Native-only reward authentication at programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/src/dispatch.rs:651 and :675."
do_4 = "Connect native_recovery_and_capacity at programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/tests/rewards_native.rs:2651 to the authenticated recovery proof while retaining its existing assertions and the storage recovery regression at :2652; the new test must prove production acceptance and refusal rather than relying on authenticate_request or verify_strict in programs/crates/layerx-programs-ai-market/tests/repair_22_33_261.rs:1245 and :1460."
